# Dependencies & build output
node_modules/
dist/
/build/
/coverage/
*.tgz
.turbo/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/

# Local secrets & env
.env
.env.local
.npmrc

# Local AI tool / agent workspaces (worktrees, scratch state).
# Anchored to the repository root: an unanchored rule also matches imported
# upstream material of the same name (docs/upstream/.../.claude/).
#
# `/.claude/*` rather than `/.claude/`, because git will not descend into an
# excluded directory and a negation below it would never be consulted. The
# skills directory is tracked repo content, not scratch: it is the Claude Code
# half of the mirror that scripts/check-skill-mirror.mjs enforces against
# .agents/skills/, and each CLI reads only its own path.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
/.worktrees/
/.codebuddy/

# Frozen upstream input snapshots. These are the read-only provenance baseline
# for drift detection (AFM-001) and source-anchor lookups -- NOTHING imports or
# builds from them. The product owns its copy of the code under packages/, and
# per docs/EXECUTION_RULES.md the repo must build with _sources/ absent.
_sources/

# Retired material, kept locally
/_archive/

# Render and capture output at the repository root. Regenerable; pinned by build
# receipts instead. Anchored: packages/studio/src/components/renders/ is source.
/out/
/renders/
*.mp4.tmp

# Evidence is a tracked deliverable in full -- receipts AND the artifacts they
# cite. docs/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md requires render tickets to produce and
# inspect real output, so a receipt whose screenshot or video is untracked is an
# unverified success claim.
#
# These were previously ignored "because artifacts are large and regenerable".
# They are not large: the whole set is 3.3 MB. The rule silently dropped 14
# artifacts, including the ones a commit titled "retain inspected proposal
# review screenshots" claimed to retain, while other evidence was force-added --
# leaving no way to tell which proof was real. Nothing under evidence/ is
# ignored.

# Local unified projects and immutable render/cache artifacts.
.vflow/
packages/studio/data/
packages/core/src/generated/
packages/producer/.debug/

# Scratch fixtures for the real-subprocess reporting tests. Removed on success;
# anchored here so an interrupted run cannot leave tracked files behind.
/packages/producer/.framework-report-*/
